{"synopsis":"Aku punya rahasia: kampung halamanku adalah planet asing yang jauh. Aku bekerja tanpa lelah tanpa dibayar dan bertahan begadang tanpa henti. Untuk melarikan diri dari pekerjaanku yang menyedihkan, aku melarikan diri ke planet yang jauh bernama “Bumi.” Dan aku melakukannya sebagai roh! Tapi sekarang, aku bereinkarnasi dalam tubuh yang kelaparan! Bisakah alien ini, yang mendarat darurat di Bumi, beradaptasi tanpa mengungkapkan identitas aslinya?","alternative_title":"이세계 착각 헌터","author":"Dae Dae Won","artist":"AB Entertainment, Yongkkeu","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"10cc0fc1-c617-4305-8158-8bd37aaef30d","number":"100","chapter":"100","title":"","date":"2026-07-29","released":"2026-07-29"},{"chapter_id":"dc36b446-ea86-4a25-88c7-367fc87f367a","number":"99","chapter":"99","title":"","date":"2026-07-22","released":"2026-07-22"},{"chapter_id":"85a8c328-fab5-40a1-a292-43d658f3ec55","number":"98","chapter":"98","title":"","date":"2026-07-21","released":"2026-07-21"},{"chapter_id":"a3c4ca38-fc67-4f3b-bc89-03edba049626","number":"97","chapter":"97","title":"","date":"2026-07-10","released":"2026-07-10"},{"chapter_id":"09177160-b477-448e-9901-eeb5f92d1ee6","number":"96","chapter":"96","title":"","date":"2026-07-03","released":"2026-07-03"},{"chapter_id":"14226b6c-f5af-4b7d-ba2f-17cf2c10dc08","number":"95","chapter":"95","title":"","date":"2026-06-27","released":"2026-06-27"},{"chapter_id":"fa653de8-ff14-4bba-ad13-3e0f346878fb","number":"94","chapter":"94","title":"","date":"2026-06-15","released":"2026-06-15"},{"chapter_id":"1d77f877-0d48-4902-806b-64a857651775","number":"93","chapter":"93","title":"","date":"2026-06-10","released":"2026-06-10"},{"chapter_id":"f8720fa7-44ad-4dfb-9f24-c2df35a62d79","number":"92","chapter":"92","title":"","date":"2026-06-09","released":"2026-06-09"},{"chapter_id":"f3c64c39-3b92-438e-a195-64b90c1eed5b","number":"91","chapter":"91","title":"","date":"2026-05-30","released":"2026-05-30"},{"chapter_id":"e28ed255-6702-4cf0-af65-71b632125831